THIS IS A LOG FILE OF STUFF CHANGED IN MAX MAXTCL CODE.

prop_menu (in sharedtcl):
	Made it accept -proptype as well proptype, for future expansion,
	and hopefully, for use in Sue.

	fixed focus to go where you click the mouse
	(lee reported)

	added -hide to disable an entry
	(lee requested)

	fixed -separator  (mha reported)

	fixed bug in code that prevents prop_menu from being FullyObscured.
	The test for [grab current] did not work.  This was probably
	the problem with the nested dialog box, too.
	Overhauled grab code.

	added -button

	made nested calls to prop_menu possible.

list_box.tcl:
	Fill em up with the directory contents.
	Marked unread cells with "U" flag.
	Added "Rescan Directory" button.
TODO:	Old routine is still there, called old_list_box_fill,
	needs to be removed.

FSBox.tcl:
	Added busy cursor.
	Fixed bug that ignored fsPattern if file was a link.
	(Sue uses its own FSBox, but seemed to already be fixed.)
	Added cursor_wait

cell.tcl:
	Made cell_load accept a directory.
	Needed to add a new cell_get like cell_load.
	Decided both should be eliminated and combined
	with :getcell/:loadcell, but need to clear with mha first.
TODO:	Talk to mha about this.  In general, want to eliminate
	duplicate procs that preserve magic compat.
	If mha doesnt want to, maybe add a "magic_compat.tcl"
	that customers can use.  But who cares?

g18.tcl (in max/tech):
	Fixed some params.

stdcell.tcl (in mmi_local):
	New faster fet flipping algorithm.
	Many changes required to retarget for g18.
	Improved pad placement.
	Added  options: align_fets, pad_track, share_contacts,
	put_fets_in_subcells
	Added Routing.


