		Modified all gate-keepers to use undo_to_delim instead of :undo,
		to fix problem where undo in a submode undid the previous thing
		done before entering the submode.

	    prop_menu: new version to support morphing dialog boxes, ie,
		an option in the dialog box can change its contents.
		Added -snap option.

	    box.tcl:   replaced several box menus with new consolidated box menu.

	    FSBox.tcl, cursor.tcl:  Worked on busy cursors a little, trying
		to get a busy in the file box while waiting.  Not done, left
		previous code working.

	    doc.tcl:  Added brackets around optional parameters to procs.
		Added support for USAGE messages - if there is a USAGE
		keyword in the description or documentation, then the doc
		module will not append another USAGE description.
		Grepped tcl files for usage messages, and made them all work.
		In general, tcl procs that have args as a param need a USAGE,
		but I did not do that yet.

	    menu_bar.tcl: Added W hot-key for wire menu.
		Made ruler a common-mode function.
		Removed references to next.tcl.

	    mode.tcl:  Removed erroneous "INTERNAL ERROR" message.

	    ruler.tcl: Modified to use lay_line -tag, other changes so ruler
		can be used from other sub-modes.  Added ruler_menu proc.
		Fixed undo for ruler mode - there is nothing to undo!

	    select.tcl:  Update box message with box size while dragging a box.

	    utils.tcl:  Added struct/destruct functions, modified res and uusnap.

	    view.tcl:  Added view_center proc, used it in wire.tcl.

	    win.tcl:  Modified cursor_msg_update and box_msg_update so
		sub-modes can modify these messages.
		Changed global variables names to use STATUS global variable.

	    wire.tcl: Pats new wiring tool, version 1.

	    zoom.tcl: Use lay_line to display zoom box - lets user still see
		current box while zooming.  Changed global variable name
		from SAVE to ZOOM to fix bug.  Fixed undo for zoom mode -
		nothing to undo!

